sequenceDiagram
    participant SP as Startup process
    participant FN as findNewestTimeLine
    participant WTL as writeTimeLineHistory
    participant FS as Filesystem
    participant CF as pg_control
    participant ARC as Archive (if archive_command)
    participant DOWN as Downstream replicas

    Note over SP: end of recovery reached<br/>(promote signal OR target hit OR EOF)
    SP->>SP: FinishWalRecovery() captures<br/>endOfLog, lastRec, lastPage
    SP->>SP: oldTLI = ThisTimeLineID;<br/>switchpoint = endOfLog
    SP->>FN: search highest TLI past oldTLI
    FN-->>SP: nextTLI = oldTLI + 1
    SP->>WTL: writeTimeLineHistory(nextTLI, oldTLI,<br/>switchpoint, "after standby")
    WTL->>FS: writeTimeLineHistoryFile pg_wal/&lt;nextTLI&gt;.history
    FS-->>WTL: fsync ok
    WTL->>ARC: XLogArchiveNotify pg_wal/&lt;nextTLI&gt;.history
    SP->>SP: ThisTimeLineID = nextTLI
    SP->>SP: emit XLOG_END_OF_RECOVERY<br/>(ThisTimeLineID=nextTLI,<br/>PrevTimeLineID=oldTLI)
    SP->>FS: RemoveNonParentXlogFiles<br/>(remove future segments on oldTLI)
    SP->>SP: CreateCheckPoint(<br/>CHECKPOINT_END_OF_RECOVERY |<br/>CHECKPOINT_IMMEDIATE)
    SP->>CF: state=DB_IN_PRODUCTION;<br/>checkPoint=newLSN<br/>(UpdateControlFile)
    SP->>SP: SharedRecoveryState=DONE
    Note over DOWN: cascading replicas
    DOWN->>DOWN: ApplyWalRecord sees<br/>XLOG_END_OF_RECOVERY,<br/>checkTimeLineSwitch,<br/>updates expectedTLEs,<br/>switches to nextTLI
